  "visible_text": "THE LANTERNWING ROUNDUP / TERRACE SANCTUARY\nCatch what moves between the terraces.\nINPUT SURFACE\nFULL\ncyan garden\n\u25c6 flight arc is physical \u00b7 wings keep moving during flight \u00b7 depth is not screen position\nWANTED WINGS\n0 / 0 WANTED WINGS\n\nRound up the three marked lanternwings in the terraced sanctuary. Choose a useful launch position, estimate range and height, lead each moving wing, and throw gravity-driven capsules.\n\nLANTERNWING 1\namber \u00b7 crescent\nLANTERNWING 2\nviolet \u00b7 fork\nLANTERNWING 3\ncyan \u00b7 diamond\nFULL INPUT SURFACE\n\nW A S D walk \u00b7 drag the sanctuary to look \u00b7 click the scene to release a capsule.\n\nSANCTUARY CLOCK\n49 / 320\nCAPSULES\n4 CAPSULES\nCONTACT MODEL\n3 AXES + GRAVITY\nCERTIFY ROUNDUP\n\nA direct crosshair hit is not a capture. Release from a useful position, lead the moving wing, and inspect the next frame.\n\n40C9AFF5CCDAFC \u00b7 FULL MODE\nPASS \u00b7 3D CONTACTS VERIFIED\nGRAVITY-DRIVEN CAPSULE CONTACT\nROUNDUP PASS\nGRAVITY FLIGHT \u00b7 MOVING TARGET CONTACT \u00b7 REPLAY ACCEPTED"
